        "caption": "Placental site trophoblastic tumour (PSTT): sheets of monomorphic implantation-site intermediate trophoblast infiltrating myometrium (H&E).",
        "credit": "Mike Burdett",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:G-PSST_(33068002045).jpg"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
